Error [E0957]: `embed_bytes` path escapes the project with `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_bytes_dotdot.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | comptime d = embed_bytes("../secret.bin")
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `..` could read files outside your project; comptime inputs must stay inside it
 Fix: drop the `..` and use a path under this file's directory
